    narr:narration """The narrative surrounding [decision capture at the point of consensus](narr:Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture) has matured from a March 2026 product thesis into a phase of empirical validation. The focus has sharpened on defining [sprint-based evidence](narr:Position_SprintFourEvidenceOfThesis) to substantiate the core differentiator. This transition is anchored by the recent deployment of the [async decision widget](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787045470058_1) and the identification of the [Zephyr integration](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787045470058_3) as a critical technical unlock. The current trajectory moves away from abstract product positioning toward verifying the efficacy of the async workflow through concrete, past-tense milestones.""" ;
